---
system: sys-07-parent-controls-summary
flow_id: config-propagation
surface: device
spec_anchor: /software/systems/07-parent-controls-summary#controls-propagation-flow
actors: [ConfigService, MQTT, Device, PostgreSQL]
apis:
  - GET /v1/config/fetch
  - POST /v1/config/applied
externals: [MQTT]
queues: []
failure_paths:
  - device_offline
  - mqtt_delivery_failure
  - signature_invalid
  - apply_timeout
idempotency: device applies highest monotonic config_version; ignores stale notifications
retry: device periodic GET /v1/config/fetch every 6 hours when offline
timeout: 60s push (online) — indefinite (offline) — 30s device ACK
status: final
---
%% HAND-CURATED. Externally-observable concurrency hint: config_version monotonic counter per Principle 1.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant ConfigService
    participant MQTT
    participant Device
    participant PostgreSQL

    ConfigService->>PostgreSQL: store signed blob (incremented config_version)
    ConfigService->>MQTT: publish device/:deviceId/config/notify {config_version}

    alt device_offline
        MQTT--xDevice: notification undelivered
        Note over Device,ConfigService: state PUSHED_TO_CONFIG — wait indefinitely
        Device->>ConfigService: (on reconnect or every 6h) GET /v1/config/fetch
    else delivered
        MQTT->>Device: config/notify {config_version}
        Device->>ConfigService: GET /v1/config/fetch
    end

    alt signature_invalid
        Device->>Device: ECDSA P-256 verify fails
        Device-->>ConfigService: (no apply — emit telemetry)
    else apply_timeout
        Device->>Device: apply takes > 30s
        Note over Device,ConfigService: re-ACK on next heartbeat
    else applied
        ConfigService-->>Device: 200 signed config blob
        Device->>Device: verify signature + apply
        Device->>ConfigService: POST /v1/config/applied {config_version, applied_at}
        ConfigService->>PostgreSQL: mark CONFIRMED
    end

    Note over ConfigService,Device: target ~1.35s end-to-end · escalation alert at 1h online / 24h offline / 72h auto-ticket
